  {
    "row": 691,
    "type": "NOTE:TNAM",
    "editor": "LDSpringvaleBossNote02",
    "en": "Some of the scabs got tired of digging the tunnel and started using mines to get into the caves.  Not a half bad idea, the explosions damn near knocked the building apart.  We got a new window or two on the side of the building. haha.  I'm going to have some of the boys knock over a caravan for more explosives, but we'll have to use fewer in the blasts, or some assholes from Megaton will come looking."
  },
